From 832ad70dd659686e0e6c7be59487f121d264dffc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Macready <william.macready@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:51:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] feat(semantics): carry physical reuse through fused and
 fault proofs

Allocation equality is explicit in prefix transport. Fused folds use expanded boundary layouts; fault outcomes carry allocation-indexed memory and preserve pre-command error snapshot refinement. Plan and Faults targets compiled with standard axioms; fixture migration remains pending.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
